# Build context hygiene. Without this file `COPY . .` shipped ~1 GB into the
# builder image — including .env.local (DB password, AUTH_SECRET, Stripe
# keys), which then stayed readable in that image layer.

# Secrets — never in an image layer
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Dependencies and build output (reinstalled/rebuilt inside the image)
node_modules
.next
out
build
*.tsbuildinfo

# Version control and local tooling
.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea

# Runtime data — mounted as a volume in production, not baked in (~136 MB)
uploads

# One-off migration source data and design artefacts
Ideiglenes
design-mockups
scripts/migrate-webflow/asset-map.json
database

# Docs
*.md
!README.md

# OS noise
.DS_Store
